{"id":"vod_md_4960","vodId":"4960","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"中二病也要谈恋爱！","name_cn":"中二病也要谈恋爱！","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230915-1/43c12139e306ede8dec8b732d68230ae.jpg"},"summary":"顺利升入高中的少年富樫勇太（福山润 配音）在初中时代曾是暗黑系的中二病患者，当年他自称黑炎之主人，自我感觉良好地度过了无厘头的中学生活。但是此刻他“痛改前非”，将这段经历看作不堪回首的耻辱过去，为此甚至不惜报考一个离家很远没有人认识自己的高中。在新的学校，勇太如愿以偿结 交了一色诚（保志总一朗 配音）、丹生谷森夏（赤崎千夏 配音）以及学姐五月七日茴香（浅仓幸美 配音）这样稍显正常的朋友，也准备和心仪的女孩大谈一场浪漫恋爱。但是令他备为挠头的是，楼上新搬来的住户兼同班同学小鸟游六花（内田真礼 配音）却是一个中二病的深度患者。小女孩每天唧唧歪歪，怪力乱神。好不容易摆脱初中阴影的勇太，高中恋爱之梦日渐飘渺……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-15 07:46:49","classic":true,"classicRank":21,"franchise":"中二病也要谈恋爱","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/HJyzRtfd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/JCRev3ka/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/paEw8m7Z/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/IP6edHYn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/zACg3d5R/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/vZl6BMDS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/LVdLvhKX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/PhLA8gqD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/daLAaLgO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/Nfv4u65K/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/ysD2LKh8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/To0Nb2qt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/w3Sx1iCN/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T15:01:59.807Z"}